{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0063_1000_023aka", "source_sha256": "b032659d300e423c021e856b3ff8f43643e00f6a65210efd860248f64e78df5f", "ja": "とりゃー！　でぇやー！　とーうっ！\n……これでどうだー！", "zh": "嘿呀──！喝啊──！咚──！\n……吃我这招──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0063_1001_p", "source_sha256": "97e50ff106ddfbe37e5e123ff63335a2a6d2417f3793adfa62efc7e196b20ded", "ja": "（騒がしい声がレッスンルームの方から響いてくる。\nこの騒々しさ、誰だか想像がつくな……）", "zh": "（有喧哗声从练习室那边传来。\n这么吵闹的感觉，可以想像得到是谁……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0063_1002_023aka", "source_sha256": "da4cb78f677adf924bf897196d59042b5208d345a06f43a676ea1ed3f158b686", "ja": "よーし、今日はコレくらいにしといてあげよう！\nいやいや、いい汗かいちゃったな～♪", "zh": "很好～今天就先到这里吧！\n哎呀哎呀，流了好多爽快的汗水～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0063_1003_p", "source_sha256": "d524032adc5ffa34b26a7469796f5aa0014b872996c803a0be15570942584ca4", "ja": "やっぱり茜だったか。今度はなんだ？", "zh": "果然是茜。这次你又在做什么啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0063_1004_023aka", "source_sha256": "a42c7dc7172cd374d35db31ca69ddd01b573b119fdc653c333285f17c9a2115f", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}ちゃん！\n茜ちゃんの秘密の特訓が見つかってしまった！？", "zh": "啊，小{$P$}！\n小茜的秘密特训被发现了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0063_1005_023aka", "source_sha256": "3dd713d3c350982c559d177cd6f0f09da9f5d3d324df4fb6c103b327dc579b9d", "ja": "見えないところで努力を惜しまない意外な一面が、\nどうやら知られてしまったようだね……！", "zh": "小茜会在私底下孜孜不倦地努力，\n这意外的一面看来被你知道了啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0063_1006_p", "source_sha256": "c0b592877b086ab6aa99ffd3bffd5afb564f88028517ee134e7d8623a4439363", "ja": "意外って、自分で言ったら意外じゃないんじゃ……。\nというか秘密だったのか？　声が聞こえてたけど。", "zh": "还好意思讲，自己说出来不就一点都不意外了吗……\n话说我都听到你的声音了，这还算是秘密吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0063_1007_023aka", "source_sha256": "dfd3846c98ed2a7bb5fd295b2ab7b28e0680248186cf0111c31e92098252fe01", "ja": "うんうん、声だけは出してたからね、声だけは！　早く\n誰か気付かないかな～って思ってたよ、ちょっとだけ！", "zh": "嗯嗯，因为只有声音没在藏啊，只有声音喔！\n本来还想说希望赶快有人注意到呢，只是稍微想想啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0063_1008_023aka", "source_sha256": "35efd4e69a2cfbee9df1933f96e759b6f65363ae556f576fba46c758ae17da9c", "ja": "見えない努力を隠さず見せるのが茜ちゃん！\nこれもサービス精神だよ！　あと褒められたいし！", "zh": "把看不见的努力尽情展现出来才符合小茜的风格！\n这也是服务精神喔！而且小茜也想被夸奖嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0063_1009_023aka", "source_sha256": "c9055a97f8408a1ce661b8c810242bd58f933b45cfaf087952a0be54ac6ace61", "ja": "{$P$}ちゃんも、せっかく茜ちゃんの\n秘密を知ったんだからほめてほめて！　ナデナデして！", "zh": "小{$P$}你也是，\n难得知道了小茜的秘密，就快夸奖啊！来摸摸头！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0063_1010_p", "source_sha256": "3c93ed23549d72b0c7f8c927487066ca7370f99dad317a9b6af08c2def65f817", "ja": "秘密……そういえば茜、\n例のかくし芸はどうなったんだ？", "zh": "秘密……这么说来，茜，\n之前说的秘密才艺怎么样了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0063_1011_023aka", "source_sha256": "1abc74275707f32ab040f5f45b1e463a4ff41d1b4e2a8b794acbe6ee5e406e50", "ja": "それそれ！　茜ちゃん、今まさに\nトランプを指に挟んで投げる練習してたんだよ～！", "zh": "就是那个！\n小茜就是在练习用手指夹住扑克牌射出去喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0063_1012_023aka", "source_sha256": "60e16fca25dc28afc34d374c8479db3a05eb1e2ef7fa18813505b0efdce43057", "ja": "{$P$}ちゃんも楽しみにしててね、\n茜ちゃんのトランプさばき♪", "zh": "小{$P$}也好好期待，\n等着看小茜的扑克牌神技吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0063_1013_023aka", "source_sha256": "fd4dec154eef3c0db37d9f8cc0a5237081382686683b552a88057300b1aa3be0", "ja": "というワケだから、今日は特別大サービス！\nナデナデとプリンのダブルごほうびで、手を打とう！", "zh": "就是这样，所以今天给你特别大放送！\n只要给小茜摸摸头和布丁的双重奖励就好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0063_1014_p", "source_sha256": "5c97bcdbe7cbdcf27a1837376882367971092927acf9e09e88efb407c96cdeee", "ja": "なんで茜が決めるんだ……まぁいいけど。", "zh": "为什么是由你来决定啊……是无所谓啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_023aka0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_023aka0063_1015_023aka", "source_sha256": "0f0ae43d2f1888a8b398e2cafa8a69344306416730a56928fff0d910c493ae61", "ja": "えっ、いいの？　ホントに？\nやったー！　{$P$}ちゃん大好き！", "zh": "咦，可以吗？真的吗？\n太棒了～！最喜欢小{$P$}了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
